WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Build an island resilience commons. Share resilience knowledge with provenance and community governance.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Map capacity, assets and dependency.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Preserve community ownership.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Carry provenance with every record.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Govern access before sharing.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Shared data should strengthen sovereignty.
